ontemplates, and the reopened request is the place to answer it: whether an=
y recording associated with event SP26097765 exists, how many, and what ret=
ention schedule applies to it =97
 covering the travel in both directions, the contact itself, and both vehic=
les.</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFo=
