<p class=3D"x_x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">The order decides my=
 petition on two grounds that did not come from my petition. It states that=
 Oregon State Police responded &quot;citing the exemption for body camera v=
ideo provided by ORS 192.345(40).&quot; That exemption
 has never been cited to me, and it appears nowhere in my petition or its e=
xhibits. The order also finds that the Department acted in good faith, whic=
h I did not allege, did not contest, and did not ask to have decided.</span=
></p>
<p class=3D"x_x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">I ask this office to=
 identify the document the exemption statement rests on. I am not asking th=
e office to revisit the order.</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">The Department reope=
ned my request on July 27 and estimated three weeks, which falls on or abou=
t August 17, 2026. I will wait for that response. If it does not resolve th=
e categories that remain outstanding,
 I will file a new petition, and if that petition is denied I will institut=
